# redswarm environment variables
#
# All LLM calls run on Cloudflare Workers AI via the AI binding in
# wrangler.jsonc — no external API keys required.
#
# Model selection can be overridden here if needed (defaults in wrangler.jsonc):
# WORKER_MODEL=@cf/meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct
# VALIDATOR_MODEL=@cf/meta/llama-3.1-70b-instruct
# REPORT_MODEL=@cf/meta/llama-3.1-70b-instruct
